          "value": "passive"
        },
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>Sickening Smell applies each round spent in the kitchen, and the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened} condition cannot be cleared whilst in the room.</p><p>At the start of your turn, make a @Check[type:fortitude|dc:26] save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> You become temporarily immune to the effects of Sickening Smell for one hour.</p><p><strong>Success</strong> No effect.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> You become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> You become @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 2} </p>",
